    <body>
Selamat siang.
<segment id='1' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='Rumah'>Ruma</segment> saya terletak di Tokyo.
Saya selalu menggunakan <segment id='2' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='Stasiun'>Sutasiun</segment> <segment id='3' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active' correction='Kameari.'>&quot;Kameari&quot;.</segment>
Kameari terletak di Kota <segment id='4' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active' correction='Katsushika.'><segment id='5' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='Katsushika.' parent='4'>&quot;Ktsusika&quot;.</segment></segment>
Ada <segment id='8' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active'>taman</segment> <segment id='9' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active'><segment id='10' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='Monchhichi' parent='9'>montiti</segment></segment> di <segment id='6' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active'>kota</segment> <segment id='7' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='Katsushika.'>Katsusika.</segment>
Ada banyak <segment id='13' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-adjektiva;urtfaj' state='active' correction='Monchhichi cantik'>cantik <segment id='11' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' comment='&quot;Monchhichi&quot; merupakan nama diri sehingga harus ditulis menggunakan huruf kapital.' parent='13'><segment id='12' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='Monchhichi' parent='11'>montiti</segment></segment></segment> di sana.
Kita tidak perlu tiket masuk waktu ke tempat itu.
<segment id='18' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prep0' state='active' correction='Masuk ke tempat'><segment id='16' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='Masuk' parent='18'>Musku</segment> <segment id='17' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-adjektiva;adjx' state='active' parent='18'>gratis</segment> tempat</segment> <segment id='19' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-adjektiva;adj0' state='active' correction='itu gratis.'>itu.
Taman</segment> itu tidak begitu luas.
Ada wahana bermain anak-anak di sana.
Orang dewasa dan anak-anak bisa <segment id='14' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nya0' state='active' correction='menikmatinya. Jika'>menikmati.
Jika</segment> Anda pergi ke <segment id='20' features='eror;leksikal;kata;prons' state='active' correction='sana,'>sini,</segment> sebaiknya <segment id='21' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbafx' state='active' correction='berfoto'>memfoto.</segment>
Kita dilarang membuang sampah di sana.
Karena <segment id='22' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active'><segment id='23' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='Monchhichi' parent='22'>montiti</segment></segment> kasihan.
<segment id='15' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktvar' state='active'>Ada <segment id='24' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;urtfn' state='active' correction='Kafe Monchhichi' parent='15'><segment id='25' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' parent='24'><segment id='26' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='Monchhichi' parent='25'>montiti</segment></segment> <segment id='27' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' parent='24'>cafe</segment></segment> di Asakusa. 
Ada <segment id='28' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-adjektiva;urtfaj' state='active' correction='makanan Monchhichi yang cantik' parent='15'><segment id='29' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;yg0' state='active' correction='Monchhichi yang cantik' parent='28'>cantik montiti</segment> <segment id='30' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prep0' state='active' correction='di tempat' parent='15'>makanan</segment> tempat</segment> itu.
Ada banyak tempat wisata.</segment>
Anda akan bisa <segment id='31' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nya0' state='active' correction='menikmatinya. Silakan'>menikmati.
Silakan</segment> <segment id='33' features='eror;gramatikal;konjungsi;konj0' state='active' correction='datang dan main'>datang <segment id='32' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'>main</segment> ya.</segment>
Selesai.    </body>
